{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1108","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"D. Diverse Garland"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have a garland consisting of $$$n$$$ lamps. Each lamp is colored red, green or blue. The color of the $$$i$$$-th lamp is $$$s_i$$$ ('"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' — colors of lamps in the garland)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to recolor some lamps in this garland (recoloring a lamp means changing its initial color to another) in such a way that the obtained garland is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"diverse"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A garland is called "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"diverse"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if any two adjacent (consecutive) lamps (i. e. such lamps that the distance between their positions is $$$1$$$) have distinct colors."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In other words, if the obtained garland is $$$t$$$ then for each $$$i$$$ from $$$1$$$ to $$$n-1$$$ the condition $$$t_i \\ne t_{i + 1}$$$ should be satisfied."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Among all ways to recolor the initial garland to make it "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"diverse"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" you have to choose one with the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of recolored lamps. If there are multiple optimal solutions, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of lamps."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of the input contains the string $$$s$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ characters '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"R"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' — colors of lamps in the garland."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first line of the output print one integer $$$r$$$ — the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of recolors needed to obtain a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"diverse"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" garland from the given one."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second line of the output print one string $$$t$$$ of length $$$n$$$ — a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"diverse"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" garland obtained from the initial one with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of recolors. If there are multiple optimal solutions, print "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"any"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n9\nRBGRRBRGG\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\nRBGRGBRGR\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n8\nBBBGBRRR\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\nBRBGBRGR\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n13\nBBRRRRGGGGGRR\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\nBGRBRBGBGBGRG\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"D","problemCode":"1108D","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codefo